<title>USA: U.S. cash soymeal - Sales made for prompt shipment.</title>
<headline>U.S. cash soymeal - Sales made for prompt shipment.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Soymeal dealers reported light to moderate cash sales Tuesday, primarily for prompt shipment.</p>
<p>Some Midwest dealers said hog producers continue to be steady buyers of soymeal to feed their larger herds. Profitable hog prices this year and forecasts for increased export demand for pork encouraged the herd expansion, livestocks analysts said.</p>
<p>Soymeal sales continue to be for prompt shipment with buyers resisting the higher prices for July and August soymeal, they said.  </p>
